      "why": "The whole point. The pinned sibling checkout exists on this machine and is byte-identical, so \"it reached ready\" is satisfied just as well by a silent fallback to it — and that fallback is exactly what would ship a dead media surface to every other machine. Only the running process's own path can tell the two apart."
